# ZVIEW04: zView started by #Z (C:\ZVIEW\ZVIEW.NAP), File > Browser... (as
# zview01's zv-browser.actions), then File > Quit WITH the browser open.
# File menu rows (zview.rsh): Browser 19 (y 28), Open, -, Information, -, Save,
# -, Print, -, Close, -, Quit 30 -> 11 rows of 16 px below Browser: y 204.
# Expected (EmuTOS): zView exits, the desktop comes back.
100 parkbr
3000 mark Z00_IDLE
3100 move 76 8
3400 mark Z01_MENU
3500 move 100 28
3700 down
3703 up
6000 mark Z02_BROWSER
6100 move 76 8
6400 mark Z03_FILEMENU
6500 move 100 204
6700 mark Z04_ONQUIT
6800 down
6803 up
# both Shift keys held 1.5 s = the AES tracer's manual flush request
# (trace.rs SHIFT_HOLD_US 0.7 s, button quiet 0.6 s), so C:\AESTRACE.BIN holds
# the Quit moment before the 20-ms poll loop wraps the ring
7200 key 2A
7201 key 36
7500 key B6
7501 key AA
8000 mark Z05_AFTERQUIT
8100 parkbr
8400 mark END
